# This repository holds the website's code and the photographs it serves (public/media) — nothing else.
#
# Not here on purpose:
#   _src/            the raw 2015 originals, the 4K masters and the per-frame reviews the image pipeline
#                    reads. They belong to the resort and are kept by the studio, not published in bulk.
#   docs/ (most)     the studio's working documents: facts ledger, build contract, art direction,
#                    keyword map, redirect manifest, voice guide, the brief. Kept in the studio vault.
/_src/
/docs/*
!/docs/INTEGRATIONS.md
!/docs/NEXT16-NOTES.md
!/docs/contrast.md
!/docs/glossary.json
